  "description": "With the 8bar PANKOW V2 you are perfectly equipped for the next world trip or the daily commute. The geometry is rather relaxed and designed for smooth riding. It is perfectly designed for longer tours on and off the road.\n\nWe’ve kept this bike as classic as possible so that you can find a replacement for your next trip around the world if something does break. With countless attachment points for bottles as well as luggage bags, it is a true pack mule.\n\nSTEEL FRAME\n\nSteel is robust, resilient and comfortable. It gives you safety and confidence for your next trip. The perfect frame material to meet the needs of commuters, nature lovers and bike packers. The classic and delicate tube design is timeless. It is both: beautiful and strong.\n\nDISC BRAKES / QUICK RELEASE STANDARD\n\nDisc brakes are the most effective brakes in any terrain. When roads get muddy and dirty your safety is guaranteed. With mechanical brakes, IS disc brakes standard and quick release you can find replacements worldwide.\n\nCAGE MOUNTS\n\nThe multiple cage mounts allow you to add bottles, fenders and bags to your bike. Numerous possibilities to be perfectly equipped for the next tour. With our reinforced luggage carrier eyelets you can add up to 25kg of load to your bike.\n\nEXTERNAL CABLE ROUTING\n\nSimple is better. With external cables you have no problem if a cable jams or you have to change it on the road.",
